<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Washington Mutual target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Washington Mutual target raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it raised its earnings estimates and target price on Washington Mutual Inc.</p>
<p>-- Said actions were based on Washington Mutual's acquiring Great Western Financial Corp now that H.F. Ahmanson and Co has dropped its bid for Great Western.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1998 operating earnings estimate to $4.85 per share from $4.60 and established 1999 estimate of $5.80.</p>
<p>-- Raised target price to $67 per share from $56.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 2-5/8 to 58-1/2.</p>
</text>
